-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 21.1.2019 — המשך הרפורמה במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה:
-- the agreement between the State and הסתדרות המורים that allocates the
-- rest of the cost frame of the colleges' reform agreement of 7.5.2015
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2015-05-07_teachers_michlalot-reform.l4):
-- academic ranks and the supplements that go with them in place of the
-- promotion grades, the 2015 and 2018 one-time grants, and a special grant
-- for teachers whose employment ended in the reorganisation; registered on
-- 15.5.2019 (no. 44/2019).
--
-- Circular תשע"ט/2 publishes the agreement for the colleges, its §§1–9 row
-- for row, and its rules were encoded there first
-- (l4/circulars/2018-19_tashat_02.l4). So each row the two print in the
-- same words is cited "as in circular תשע"ט/2", by the rule that encodes it
-- there, and this file imports the circular; a row the circular prints with
-- other words says what differs. The circular's §8(א) prints the 2018
-- grant's last salary as "June 2018" (its [כך במקור]); this agreement
-- prints June 2019, the day the circular's rule already reads. What the
-- circular leaves out — the agreement's own preamble and §§10–16, the
-- settlement of disputes, the exhaustion of claims, industrial peace,
-- cooperation, earlier terms and the follow-up committee — is encoded here.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `2018-19_tashat_02`
IMPORT minimum_wage_law

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘משרה מלאה’ and
-- ‘היקף משרה’ here measure the position, as the base of a sum paid pro rata
-- to it or a threshold of eligibility; they set no working hour, day or
-- week, nor the pay of an hour the law counts.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘בעל’ is holding or having (‘בעל דרגה’), not a
-- husband; none gives pay or other remuneration by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיום 21.1.2019 — המשך הרפורמה במכללות`

-- The Women's Work Law (through circular תשע"ט/2): §7(ה)–(ז) count the
-- birth and parenthood period toward the grant, at the position on its
-- eve, as the circular that publishes them does. The floor is met.
`as in circular תשע"ט/2, §7 counts the birth and parenthood period toward the grant` MEANS
    `§7 of תשע"ט/2 counts the birth and parenthood period, as the Women's Work Law keeps it`
#ASSERT `as in circular תשע"ט/2, §7 counts the birth and parenthood period toward the grant`

§§ `המבוא`

