-- akn:preamble/p4 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15.5.2019, number 44/2019; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 The parties: the State, by the wages commissioner Kobi Bar-Natan and the director-general Shmuel Abuav, and הסתדרות המורים, by its secretary-general Yaffa Ben-David; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 Recitals: the colleges' reform agreement of 7.5.2015, its cost frame, and the negotiation on the rest of it for promoting ranks and the matters it named.
-- akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 A recital that the parties set their agreement down here, and the words of agreement; no rule.

`the agreement of 21.1.2019 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 21 1 2019

§§ `1–9, כפי שחוזר תשע"ט/2 מפרסם אותם`

-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: §5(א)(4) and (ד)(5) counts
-- the trailing promotion grade supplement and the shekel supplement in the
-- wage severance is computed on, and §7(ח) leaves the 2015 grant out of it.
-- Which components count, §13 sends to the regulations, which compute that
-- wage by the collective agreement that applies (as the takanon's §1.28.2.3
-- brings them): a component counted adds to the severance, and for one left
-- out the agreement's word is what the law looks to; §13ב's minimum-wage
-- floor holds whatever is counted.

