-- Against the Minimum Wage Law's floor (MMS-601): §7(ט) is the circular's
-- word for word, and so is its rule: the 2015 grant is left out of the pay
-- that counts toward the top-up, which makes the top-up the law's or more
-- (its §11). Checked on a month's figures as if §3 counted it (a fixed
-- supplement for the work), the strictest case.
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the one-time grants count for` `topping up to the minimum wage`)

§§ `10 סכסוכי עבודה`

-- §10: from the signing every labour dispute over the colleges' teachers is
-- void, the dispute of 23.5.2017 among them.
@ref akn:art_10/p1
`the labour disputes over the colleges' teachers stand after 21.1.2019` MEANS FALSE

DECLARE `colleges action of 21.1.2019` IS ONE OF
    `negotiate further on the cost frame or the colleges' reform`
    `negotiate further economic demands to 30.6.2019`
    `consult or negotiate on new documents about merging colleges`
    `demand pay, retirement terms or money in that negotiation`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 21.1.2019 settles`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over further economic demands to 30.6.2019`
    `help and cooperate in completing the colleges' reform`
    `follow the agreement and decide disputes on it`

§§ `11 מיצוי תביעות`

-- (א): the agreement exhausts the parties' claims on what it settles, §10
-- of the colleges' reform agreement among them. (ב): no further
-- negotiation on the cost frame or the reform — its allocation, the pay and
-- terms of the colleges' teachers. (ג): and none on further economic
-- demands for the period to 30.6.2019. (ד): this takes nothing from the
-- exhaustion clauses already between the parties.
@ref akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_11__para_b akn:art_11__para_c akn:art_11__para_d
`the economic demands of 21.1.2019 are exhausted to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2019

`no further negotiation after 21.1.2019` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate further on the cost frame or the colleges' reform`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `colleges action of 21.1.2019`
DECIDE `no further economic demands on` d IS
    IF DATE_SERIAL d AT MOST DATE_SERIAL `the economic demands of 21.1.2019 are exhausted to`
    THEN PARTY `the teachers' union`
         SHANT `negotiate further economic demands to 30.6.2019`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- (ה): notwithstanding, in view of the proceeding in the Tel Aviv regional
-- labour court (31647-02-18) and the parties' statements of 11.4.2017, and
-- without derogating from the State's claims: ¶2, where new documents on
-- merging the colleges change the academic staff's conditions in
-- professional respects that could not have come up in the reform
-- agreement or this one, there is consultation or negotiation for 3 months
-- from them; where it is a negotiation, (1) no pay, retirement terms, the
-- end-of-employment procedure's matters or money are demanded in it, nor
-- what the two agreements settled; (2) all its fruits together stay within
-- a budget the parties agree in writing, with a written record of what is
-- left; (3) industrial peace stands.
-- not weighed against `the Advance Notice Law`: (ה)(1) names the colleges' procedure
-- for ending employment only as a matter no demand is raised on; it gives or
-- asks no notice, and the procedure itself is outside the corpus.
@ref akn:art_11__para_e akn:art_11__para_e/p2 akn:art_11__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_11__para_e__subpara_2 akn:art_11__para_e__subpara_3
`the months to consult on new merger documents` MEANS 3

GIVEN `the new documents change professional conditions the two agreements could not have raised` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `colleges action of 21.1.2019`
DECIDE `consulting on new merger documents` `the new documents change professional conditions the two agreements could not have raised` IS
    IF `the new documents change professional conditions the two agreements could not have raised`
    THEN PARTY `the State`
         MUST  `consult or negotiate on new documents about merging colleges`
         WITHIN `the months to consult on new merger documents` TIMES 30
         HENCE (PARTY `the teachers' union`
                SHANT `demand pay, retirement terms or money in that negotiation`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `the fruits of the negotiations together` IS A NUMBER, `the budget agreed in writing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the merger negotiations stay within their budget` `the fruits of the negotiations together` `the budget agreed in writing` IF
    `the fruits of the negotiations together` AT MOST `the budget agreed in writing`

#ASSERT `the merger negotiations stay within their budget` 100 100
#ASSERT NOT `the merger negotiations stay within their budget` 101 100

§§ `12 שקט תעשייתי`

-- (א): no strike, lockout or organised disruption over what the agreement
-- settles; (ב): nor over further economic demands for its employees until
-- 30.6.2019; (ג): this takes nothing from the industrial peace already
-- between the parties.
@ref akn:art_12__para_a akn:art_12__para_b akn:art_12__para_c
`industrial peace of 21.1.2019` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 21.1.2019 settles`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `colleges action of 21.1.2019`
DECIDE `industrial peace over economic demands of 21.1.2019 on` d IS
    IF DATE_SERIAL d AT MOST DATE_SERIAL `the economic demands of 21.1.2019 are exhausted to`
    THEN PARTY `the teachers' union`
         SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over further economic demands to 30.6.2019`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `13 שיתוף פעולה`

-- §13: the colleges' teachers help and cooperate as needed to complete the
-- reform and meet its aims.
@ref akn:art_13/p1
`cooperating in the colleges' reform` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `help and cooperate in completing the colleges' reform`

§§ `14 תנאים קודמים`

-- §14: earlier terms stand in the agreement's period unless it amends or
-- cancels them, expressly or by implication.
@ref akn:art_14/p1
`earlier terms stand after 21.1.2019 unless amended` MEANS TRUE

§§ `15 הסדר שלם`

-- §15: the agreement is one whole arrangement: its provisions are bound
-- together, and none applies without the others.
@ref akn:art_15/p1
`a provision of 21.1.2019 applies without the others` MEANS FALSE

§§ `16 ועדת מעקב`

-- §16: a follow-up committee — the wages commissioner, the Ministry of
-- Education's director-general and the union's secretary-general — follows
-- the agreement and decides disputes on it, finally and binding the
-- parties.
@ref akn:art_16/p1
`following the agreement of 21.1.2019` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `follow the agreement and decide disputes on it`

`the follow-up committee's decisions of 21.1.2019 are final` MEANS TRUE

